cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FlexMapping
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dreyer
    given-names: Malte
repository-code: https://github.com/maltedreyer-5/flexmapping
abstract: >-
  FlexMapping extracts structured records from public web pages and publishes
  them as a static website. Content types are defined in YAML; each field is
  extracted by its own prompt and evaluated by a separate validation call that
  returns a quality class, a score and a justification.
keywords:
  - information extraction
  - large language models
  - web crawling
  - research information
  - static site generation
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
